    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d793">

                <pb facs="0856" n="844" sameAs="frus:frus1945v04/pg844"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Budapest Legation Files: 711.9 ACC</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chairman of the Allied Control Commission for
                        Hungary</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Voroshilov</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Chief of the United States Military
                        Representation on the Allied Control Commission for Hungary</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Key</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 614</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Budapest</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-08-14">14 August, 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear General</hi>: The Berlin Conference brought a
                    decision about the question concerning the revision of the procedure of the
                    Allied Control Commissions in Roumania, Bulgaria and Hungary,<anchor n="18"
                        xml:id="d793-f1"/> according <pb facs="0857" n="845" xml:id="pg845"/> to
                    which the Statute of ACC for Hungary was accepted as basis for the Allied
                    Control Commissions in these countries.</p>
                <p>In connection with this I have the honour to submit to you the new Statute of ACC
                    in Hungary.</p>
                <p>I remain, with great and permanent esteem to you,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>K. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Voroshilov</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d793-a1.xml" xpointer="d793-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
